        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "<p>Health Foundation paper argues health is an economic asset and improving it could generate £72bn for public finances</p><p>Restoring the deteriorating health of the UK’s population to the level of 2014 would boost GDP by 2% and generate a £72bn dividend for the public finances, research suggests.</p><p>A <a href=\"https://www.health.org.uk/reports-and-analysis/reports/health-as-an-economic-asset\">paper by the Health Foundation thinktank</a>, published on Sunday, argues the nation’s health should be valued by policymakers as an economic asset.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/society/2026/jul/19/restoring-britains-health-to-2014-levels-could-add-2-to-gdp-thinktank-says\">Continue reading...</a>"
